## Eccosorb slab: edit the grade and slab dimensions for your own model.
## All coordinates are in metres. The material JSON stays beside this file.

## 1. Simulation settings: 48 mm cube, 1 mm cells, 2 ns recording time.
#title: Eccosorb LS22 slab with a source and receiver
#domain: 0.048 0.048 0.048
#dx_dy_dz: 0.001 0.001 0.001
#time_window: 2e-9
#pml_cells: 6
#num_threads: 2

## 2. Material: the selected JSON entry includes its three Debye poles.
#material_from_database: eccosorb eccosorb_ls22

## 3. Geometry: a 28 x 28 x 6 mm slab, surrounded by free space.
## The final 'n' disables material averaging at the slab interfaces.
#box: 0.010 0.010 0.022 0.038 0.038 0.028 eccosorb_ls22 n

## 4. Excitation and output: x-polarised source below, receiver above the slab.
#waveform: ricker 1 3e9 pulse
#hertzian_dipole: x 0.024 0.024 0.014 pulse
#rx: 0.024 0.024 0.035 probe Ex Ey Ez
